(V/'README.txt').write_text(f'CLAUDE MANAGED AGENTS: {TITLE.upper()}\nDuration: {stamp}. 1920x1080, 30 fps, H.264/AAC. Inworld Yash, TTS 2, enhanced, balanced delivery, speaking rate 1.25, 48kHz.\n\n38 scenes: cover; overview; Lab 01; Learn tab; 6 concept map regions; 3 lab walkthrough steps; exercise; offline normal turn (metadata and text, lifecycle and outcome, raw events); repeated events; stream ended; session error; live disabled; enabling live in .env; restart; live ready; live session; live answer; live lifecycle and outcome; offline vs live; 5 TypeScript code tour sections; Agent SDK to Managed Agents mapping and live-port source (platform source viewer); knowledge check; summary.\n\nCaptured from the platform running in a fresh clone (C:\\Students). Exactly one billed live run was made: completed, end_turn, 42 events, remote session archived. MANAGED_LIVE_ENABLED was set back to false afterwards.\n\nRebuild (platform running from the clone): node scripts/capture-lab01-walkthrough.mjs offline; enable live, restart, node scripts/capture-lab01-walkthrough.mjs live; python scripts/create-lab01-walkthrough.py; node scripts/capture-lab01-walkthrough-slides.mjs; python scripts/create-lab01-walkthrough.py; python scripts/audit-lab01-walkthrough.py; python -u scripts/build-narrated-presentation.py --project {N}; python scripts/finish-lab01-walkthrough.py\n',encoding='utf-8')
